\section*{Mathematical Foundation}

All engines follow the general form:
\begin{equation}
  \frac{d\bm{X}}{dt} = \bm{F}(\bm{X}(t), t),
\end{equation}
with invariants:
\begin{equation}
  \mathcal{R} = R_1 \land R_2 \land \dots \land R_k.
\end{equation}

Stability is evaluated using a Lyapunov functional:
\begin{equation}
  V(\bm{X})
  = \frac{1}{2}
    \left\lVert \bm{X}(t) - \bm{X}^\ast \right\rVert^2,
\end{equation}
with convergence condition:
\begin{equation}
  \frac{dV}{dt} < 0.
\end{equation}

